Board of County Commissioners
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
August 19, 2025
3.
Consideration of a legal services contract between Laramie County,
WY, and Ronnie Lopez and/or his designee to provide hearing officer
services for administrative hearings, legal counsel to the Laramie
County Board of Equalization, and to serve as hearing officer for the
2025 CBOE appeal hearings at a rate of $280/hour.
25 - 369
Legal Services Contract, CBOE, Ronnie Lopez
Attachments:
This agenda item was approved.
4.
Consideration of a memorandum of understanding between Laramie
County, WY, and the University of Wyoming to authorize expenditures
to support Extension programs from July 1, 2025, through June 30,
2027.
25 - 370
MOU, UW Extension
Attachments:
This agenda item was approved.
5.
Consideration of a subaward agreement between WY Dept of
Transportation and Laramie County, WY, for a FFY26 Highway Safety
Program, Occupant Protection High Visibility Enforcement Overtime
grant in the amount of $10,818.18 to run through Sept 30, 2026.
25 - 367
FFY26 HSP Subaward Agreement, WYDOT, HVE
Attachments:
This agenda item was approved.
6.
Consideration of a subaward agreement between WY Dept of
Transportation and Laramie County, WY, for a FFY26 Highway Safety
Program, Impaired Driving High Visibility Enforcement Overtime and
Multi-Jurisdiction Enforcement in the amount of $34,171.99 to run
through Sept 30, 2026.
25 - 368
FFY26 HSP Subaward Agreement, WYDOT, HVE
Mulit-Jurisdiction Enforcement
Attachments:
This agenda item was approved.
7.
Consideration of a grant agreement between Cheyenne Regional
Medical Center and Laramie County, WY, for a Community Benefit
grant award in the amount of $1,500 to provide funds to Law
Enforcement Assisted Diversion Program to purchase meals and/or
groceries for participants to run through June 30, 2026.
25 - 373
Community Benefit Award, CRMC, LEAD
Attachments:
This agenda item was approved.
